== Effects ==
* When at exactly 1 {{E|Red Heart}}, some of Isaac's stats are increased.
** {{Dlc|nr}} +0.75 [[tears]].
** {{Dlc|r}} +2.0 [[fire rate]]. The bonus can break the soft tears cap.
** +1.5 [[range]].
** {{Dlc|nr}} +1 [[tear falling speed]].
** +0.2 [[shot speed]].
* The effect is lost any time Isaac gains or loses Red Hearts.
** The crown will glow red while active; if inactive, it will appear black.

== Notes ==
* Full Bone Heart containers are counted towards the maximum.
* {{E|Rotten Heart}}s count as Red Hearts.
* This item pairs well with {{C|Eve}}, since she starts with {{i|Whore of Babylon}}, and is the only character that can gain Whore of Babylon's effect at 1 heart.
* This item does not affect {{C|???}}, {{C|The Lost}}, {{C|The Soul}}, {{dlc|r}}{{C|Black Judas}}, {{C|Tainted Judas}}, {{C|Tainted ???}}, {{C|Tainted Lost}}, {{C|Tainted Soul}}, or {{C|Tainted Bethany}} since they cannot gain Red Hearts.
* This item only affects {{C|Keeper}} and {{C|Tainted Keeper}} when he has only one [[Health#Coin Hearts|Coin Heart]].
* This item only affects {{C|The Forgotten}} when he has one full Bone Heart.
* The effect does not stack with multiple Dark Prince's Crowns.

